WEBVTT

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:33.040
The scorching-hot sun...

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:36.860
The sparkling ocean...

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:38.510
The gorgeous blue sky!

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:42.910
A beach that's like an endless stretch of white sand!

00:01:43.510 --> 00:01:45.060
But where exactly...

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:47.620
Is all of that?

00:01:48.140 --> 00:01:51.860
So, uh... Just why did we come all the way out to the beach today?

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:55.340
Well, I didn't know a typhoon was comin'!

00:01:56.090 --> 00:01:58.250
I never watch boring stuff like the weather!

00:01:58.690 --> 00:01:59.810
We should get out sometimes, ya know?

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:03.740
So thought I'd be nice an' make some reservations for this resort, okay?!

00:02:03.740 --> 00:02:06.100
Jeez! I don't go back on my promises!

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:12.120
Well, thanks to this weather I can sit around at the beach without having to wear sunscreen. Wow.

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:18.110
But... there's no good looking guys out, or even anyone at all!

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:21.900
Since... since it's my first time at the beach,

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:24.110
I'd like to tell you guys my dreams.

00:02:25.890 --> 00:02:30.480
Like flirting with some hot guy atop the warm sand...

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:33.090
Having an adventure together!

00:02:35.470 --> 00:02:36.780
That'd be nice...

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:37.930
Yeah...

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.950
I get it!

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:44.060
I just need to do somethin' about this, right?

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:52.570
O great Sun, with your strong rays, teruteru pika~n, teru pika~n, dispel these clouds!

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.950
Another failure?

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.380
Over there...

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.520
Ya! It really worked!

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:09.830
Yay~! I did it!

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:12.920
Ehehe. Now, let's get goin'!

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:16.050
We're going all the way over there?

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:17.670
Y-you're not?

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:21.630
You all told me to make the beach sunny and dry, so I did...

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:23.680
You all told me...

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:27.360
Fine, fine. Let's go.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.290
I guess so.

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:36.440
Pokaan ~ 9

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:36.440
A Tiring Spell Is a Trip to the Beach

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:35.720
A Tiring Spell Is a Trip to the Beach!

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:42.700
Still, why's it gotta be so far away?

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:45.990
There's nothin' we can do about it!

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:50.290
It's 'cause I'm not that good at controlling magic, and I'm only a level 3 alchemist!

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:56.130
I suppose... But still, why does it have to be so far away?

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.490
It can't be helped.

00:03:58.490 --> 00:04:03.010
It's 'cause I'm not that good at controlling magic, and I'm only a level 3 alchemist!

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:06.640
I see, but even so... why?

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:10.730
Hey! Fine, go ahead and leave me behind!

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:13.850
Oh, I get it! You're mad at me for messin' up huh?!

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:17.190
We're here!

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.110
Yaaay!

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:21.610
It's so bright!

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.690
It's so intense!

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:29.080
So this is a beach during summer?

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:51.750
Uma, quick, use your magic again!

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:52.850
Your magic, your magic!

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:54.350
O-okay!

00:04:54.760 --> 00:05:01.510
Sun, once again, teruteru pika~n teru pika~n, dispel these clouds!

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:14.160
My, my! You're all drenched!

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:16.580
Here, dry yourself off with these.

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:23.210
Your room is on the second floor.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:28.280
It's here!

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:29.680
Woah!

00:05:30.160 --> 00:05:32.770
The oce-aaah!

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:36.900
We'll get wet again, jeez.

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:46.410
We go through all of this to get to the beach, and I'm not even getting a tan.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:49.240
It doesn't feel like a beach trip at all.

00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:50.660
Sure doesn't...

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:53.580
That's it! Let's have a beach trip right here!

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:54.620
Hm?

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:59.710
We're inside, so we won't get wet, and we can see the beach from the window, too!

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:03.340
C'mon, let's do it!

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:24.230
Excuse me! Your dinner is...

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:26.740
JAM IT IN!

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:31.770
Young ladies, just what are you thinking?!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:35.360
No matter how much it's raining outside, something like this...

00:06:35.360 --> 00:06:38.580
And on tatami mats, this is the first time anyone has ever done that!

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.000
I cannot believe this!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.620
This is simply unfathomable!

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:45.170
Ladies

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:48.130
She didn't have to get so angry...

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:51.430
It was so stormy at the beach...

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:55.540
And I wanted another fish for dinner, too.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:02.400
Hey, what're you doing? You're such a little kid.

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:04.920
Alright, I need the exercise.

00:07:04.920 --> 00:07:06.320
I guess I'll take a swim too!

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.820
Swim!

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:10.380
Time to swim!

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:13.260
Do your best, you two!

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:16.400
Excuse me, this isn't the ocean...

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:19.070
Ocean?

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.800
Nudist beaches rule!

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:32.180
Hey, do oceans this hot really exist?

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:33.730
Yeah...

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:36.010
That's an awesome idea, Liru-chan!

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:38.600
Alright! Let's get some water goin'...

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:42.570
But hey, it isn't an ocean without salt water!

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:43.840
You're right about that!

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:47.920
Salt, salt!

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:49.600
Ladies, how's the water temp--

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:54.310
Just how many times do I have to tell you?

00:07:54.310 --> 00:07:56.770
The other customers are going to use this too!

00:07:56.770 --> 00:07:58.550
Just what are you thinking?!

00:07:58.550 --> 00:08:02.900
No matter how much it's raining outside, this is the first time I've had customers so such a thing!

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:05.040
I cannot believe this! This is simply unfathomable!

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:15.900
Hehe, I wonder if it's still a beach trip if it's at night?

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:20.380
Hrrm... It's a good thing that the rain let up, huh, Ai-chan?

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:26.820
Good thing it's not a full moon, or else you'd transform!

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:33.550
Alright, I think I'm gonna take a dip!

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:35.960
Here I go!

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:41.580
It's so cold!! But fun! Really, look how much fun it is!

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:44.860
Guys, come over here!

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:48.420
Sheesh. It's hopeless...

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:51.530
See? It's fine.

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:54.270
I'll have fun on my own!

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:56.510
I'm the only one swimming in the sea!

00:08:56.510 --> 00:09:00.140
It's reserved just for me! Check it out! Ha!

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:01.690
Ow!

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:02.630
Good evening.

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:03.230
Huh?

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:06.270
Are you alone?

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:10.960
Those people over there are complete strangers!

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:12.740
I have no idea who they are!

00:09:12.740 --> 00:09:14.900
Yes, I'm all alone!

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:19.540
Hm? Who is Uma-san swimming with?

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:25.460
Look like it's a young man...

00:09:26.820 --> 00:09:33.470
Hm? What? Pachira-san, Liru-san, it takes me a while to get ready!

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:35.510
If you're getting in the water, please tell me in advance!

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.710
I'm Umino Sachio.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:38.470
And you are?

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:40.760
Me? I'm Uma.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.260
I'm Pachira!

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:43.720
I'm Liru! Nice to meet you!

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:46.380
Pachi-chan! Liru-chan!

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:49.480
Hm? Didn't you say you were on your own?

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.530
What was that?!

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:55.300
What the hell you think you were gonna do, flirting with him by yourself?

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:56.710
Uma...

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.380
But you were all so mean to me!

00:09:59.380 --> 00:10:01.690
I was all on my own until now!

00:10:01.690 --> 00:10:03.260
Well, yeah...

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:05.950
Now, now, ladies. Let's not fight.

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.460
Let's have some fun!

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:08.960
Oh you...

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.960
We're not fighting!

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:14.200
See? We're this close!

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:15.300
Yeah, yeah.

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.760
Anyway, can I call you Sachio?

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:18.810
Of course.

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:22.050
You can call me whatever you want, my little kittens.

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:26.500
What should we do now?

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:29.170
Hm, what's good?

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:32.730
Ooh, what can just one guy do with three girls? Huh?!

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.620
Noo~

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:41.460
They're so mean, leaving me on my own and going off to play.

00:10:45.030 --> 00:10:47.160
I've finally caught up to th-

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:48.660
A fish?

00:10:52.780 --> 00:10:53.900
Fire!

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:02.370
Everyone, I've found a big fish!

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:10.230
You're so cruel!

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:13.520
You couldn't tell that I was a mermaid?

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:15.770
You dreadful women...

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:17.710
I'll pay you back for this!

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:22.570
I won't forget about this, YOU HEAR?

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:27.450
Ow! Ow! Ow! Mommy!

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:39.760
Let's just forget about that...

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:41.570
Yeah... Let's...

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:43.210
Yeah...

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:15.000
I wonder where all that wind and rainy commotion yesterday disappeared to...

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:16.390
Dunno!

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:18.000
Eh?

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:22.610
Well anyway, the sun is out now! I can get a great tan now!

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:24.840
Look out boys, here I come!

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:27.210
Time to get to flirting!

00:12:27.400 --> 00:12:30.100
I'll finally get to go on an adventure!

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:33.610
Ain't there any hot guys around here?!

00:12:35.970 --> 00:12:37.520
Poor kid.

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:40.650
Maybe we should introduce her to someone we know.

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.470
Aww, you're so sweet.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.360
L...let's swim.

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:48.200
Yeah.

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:52.250
Time to kick the ocean's ass!

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:56.510
H-hey, I told you guys to tell me in advance when you're going into the ocean!

00:12:58.020 --> 00:13:02.970
Pokaan ~ 10

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:01.360
Love's Spell Is a Trip to the Beach!

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:06.300
Aww, jeez...

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:11.810
Why did we have to come all the way out here? All the guys are over there!

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:16.230
But Pachi-chan, there's not much of a difference "there" for you!

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:27.420
Are you trying to k-kill me?

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:31.660
Jeez! If you're gonna be like that, I'll use my magic!

00:13:32.430 --> 00:13:34.680
Release!

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:36.440
Tear. Poke!

00:13:40.740 --> 00:13:42.790
Are you trying to k-kill me?

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:45.270
You started it, Pachi-chan!

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:47.550
Hey, stop it, you two!

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:49.390
Come on

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:52.140
Quit it already. STOP!

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:55.140
I've finally caught up to all of you!

00:13:55.320 --> 00:13:58.230
Right as my power ran out...

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.230
What the hell you doin'?

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:25.080
Huh? Where are we?

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:27.380
It looks like we've been saved.

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:29.570
As expected of me!

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:31.640
I saved us all with my magic, right?

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:36.640
Um... I saved you.

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:38.850
What the heck are you?

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:44.900
I'm the princess of the mermaids, Lulu.

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:46.990
Wow, how about that!

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:50.340
Thank you for saving all of us, Lulu-san.

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:53.590
That aside, there really are a lot of mermaids in this ocean.

00:14:53.590 --> 00:14:57.410
Hey, you know, we're all princesses too!

00:14:58.510 --> 00:15:01.120
My, is that so?

00:15:01.120 --> 00:15:03.250
What an interesting coincidence.

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:07.920
It must be fate that brought us together.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:13.150
In fact, I have a request for all of you.

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:15.770
A request?

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:18.280
Well, she did save us.

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:19.730
Yeah.

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:22.120
As long as it isn't anything too annoyin'!

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:25.460
Thank you so much!

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:27.170
The truth is, I...

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.150
I've fallen in love.

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:29.890
Oh?

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:31.740
Oh, um...

00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:34.050
So what kind of guy is he?

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:34.950
Is he cool?

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:37.200
Well, he's...

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:39.080
Hey, hey! How far have you guys gone?

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:40.260
A?

00:15:40.260 --> 00:15:41.050
B?

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:42.180
More?

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:46.680
Well, I haven't confessed my love to him yet...

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:47.990
Oh, whatever then.

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:49.310
That sucks.

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:52.550
And, what do you want from us?

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:54.210
Umm...

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:57.560
I was wondering if I could get your help so that it'll go well.

00:15:58.240 --> 00:16:00.420
I have a body like this, so...

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:03.140
I've only been watching him from afar.

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:06.650
So the other guy's human?

00:16:06.650 --> 00:16:07.860
Oh.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:11.990
I got it! We will become your cupids!

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:13.970
Really?

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:16.180
So, what's the guy like?

00:16:16.180 --> 00:16:17.610
Do you have a picture?

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:21.650
Oh, yeah. Here you go.

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:24.540
Ah, I can see why you'd like him. Pretty good!

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:29.170
Isn't he? I've never seen someone that wonderful!

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:36.390
Those manly eyebrows, those eyes that almost look wet, that stately nose, his bright white teeth!

00:16:36.710 --> 00:16:40.540
No matter what it is, everything about him is good looking!

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:43.740
But, if it doesn't go well, don't get mad at us.

00:16:43.740 --> 00:16:47.470
We're pretty good looking too, so he might fall in love with us!

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.800
Please don't cry!

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:52.260
Something like that isn't possible!

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:53.950
It's fine!

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.240
Really?

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:56.430
Really!

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:57.660
Leave it to us!

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:01.250
Here, say "Ah!"

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:03.180
Ahh!

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:04.960
Looks like he fell in love with her.

00:17:05.090 --> 00:17:07.560
How are you so cute?

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:10.550
Even the sun gets burned from looking at your beauty.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:12.170
Oh, it does!

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:13.260
What should we do?

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:15.470
I've just figured it out...

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:19.070
That I was born into this world to love you!

00:17:19.070 --> 00:17:20.220
I'm so happy!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:21.910
Uma-san.

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:23.030
What should we do?

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:26.440
Honestly, I think we should just leave them alone.

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:27.390
Ahem.

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:32.540
Oh you, already sayin' dirty things like that to me.  Jeez!

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:33.990
Um... Excuse me!

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:37.420
I'm sorry for butting in, but please listen!

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:40.450
There's someone that's had you in her mind for a very long time!

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:43.700
Someone that wants to go out with you!

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:45.830
Wow, I'm flattered!

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:47.760
Then, will you meet her?

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:49.040
But, you know...

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:52.370
I've found the honey for me!

00:17:52.370 --> 00:17:53.830
That'd be me!

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:57.880
How'd it go?

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:00.050
Um, well...

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:03.950
Oh yeah, he was a great guy!

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:06.270
He really was! He seemed so kind!

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:07.780
Didn't he?

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:15.290
I bet that he must kind to children, and he definitely stands boldly against evil!

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:18.780
He's that kind of man, definitely! It has to be true,

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:19.750
no doubt about it!

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:22.130
Honey!

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:23.320
Darling!

00:18:23.320 --> 00:18:24.500
Honey!

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:25.450
Dar-

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:27.910
What the hell are you doing?

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.000
That hurts, Pachi-chan.

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:37.110
Why do we have to work here in the hot sun while you have fun with some guy?

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:38.910
It's ridiculous!

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:41.220
