00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:20.820
I'm really sorry...

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:25.350
But the truth is, I've found an even more wonderful boyfriend!

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:28.100
Look, isn't he so cool?

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:30.770
His white, shiny skin,

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:33.650
