00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:38.300
J-

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:39.660
Jelly-

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:40.450
fish?

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:44.180
I'm sorry for causing you so much trouble,

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:49.610
but now it's time to make some wonderful memories of this summer, so we'll be leaving you now!

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:56.190
